<title>HUNGARY: PRIMAGAZ SETS UP JOINT VENTURE WITH SWISS DIVERTEC.</title>
<headline>PRIMAGAZ SETS UP JOINT VENTURE WITH SWISS DIVERTEC.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungarian gas distributor Primagaz Rt said on Tuesday it had launched a 50-50 joint venture with Switzerland's Divertec S.A. for the bottling and trading of cooling agents.</p>
<p>The new company, called Frigogaz Kft, was set up with 45 million forint capital and was registered in Budaors, Primagaz said in the official bourse gazette.</p>
<p>Budaors is a few kilometers away from the Hungarian capital.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
